# Pi

{{ template "agents-shared.md" . }}

Use Pi lanes for OpenAI and other allowed non-Anthropic models, and Claude Code lanes for Anthropic models. Pi handles background lane continuation, including failures while siblings continue; inspect results before reporting acceptance. Keep cross-provider dispatch with the parent and give workers bounded tasks. When opening Plannotator or a grill review, include the plannotator-url output for access from another device.
